# A possible UK energy system in 2050, in terawatt-hours a year: where the energy comes from,
# what it is converted into, and where it ends up. From the plotly.js test mock sankey_energy.json
# (MIT, see LICENSE.md), after the UK DECC 2050 Calculator data in the d3-sankey energy example.
